VALUES
  (
    4,
    'EO GSEA Uttarakhand: Anagha Cleaners Shines Bright',
    'eo-gsea-uttarakhand-anagha-cleaners-shines-bright',
    'We are thrilled to celebrate the outstanding achievement of Anagha Cleaners, an incubatee at the Genesis Incubator, Quantum University Roorkee. Their dedication, hard work, and innovative thinking have earned them a remarkable milestone at one of the most prestigious student entrepreneurship competitions.',
    '<p>We are thrilled to celebrate the outstanding achievement of Anagha Cleaners, an incubatee at the Genesis Incubator, Quantum University Roorkee. Their dedication, hard work, and innovative thinking have earned them a remarkable milestone at one of the most prestigious student entrepreneurship competitions.</p><p></p><p>Anagha Cleaners secured the Runner-Up position at the EO GSEA Uttarakhand chapter, winning a grant of ₹1.75 lac. This achievement highlights not only their entrepreneurial spirit but also the growing startup culture within the Quantum University ecosystem.</p><p></p><p>The EO GSEA (Global Student Entrepreneur Awards) is a globally recognized platform that brings together the brightest student entrepreneurs. With top talent from across Uttarakhand participating, standing out in such a competitive environment is a commendable accomplishment.</p><p></p><p>Next Stop: Regional and National Rounds!</p><p></p><p>With their strong performance at the state level, Anagha Cleaners will now proudly represent Uttarakhand in the regional and national rounds. They will compete with some of the most promising young entrepreneurs from all over India, taking one step closer to making a national impact.</p><p></p><p>We extend our heartfelt congratulations to the entire Anagha Cleaners team for their inspiring success. The Quantum family celebrates this moment with pride and wishes them the very best for the upcoming rounds. Their journey is a perfect example of how passion, innovation, and perseverance can take student entrepreneurs to new heights.</p>',
    'Genesis Team',
    1,
    'https://media.genesis-quic.in/blogs/1764100667708-hyw2qfq-whatsapp-image-2025-11-22-at-4-29-57-pm.jpeg',
    1,
    'published',
    45,
    0,
    '2025-11-25 19:58:08',
    '2025-11-25 19:58:10',
    '2026-08-11 08:27:26'
  );

