VALUES
  (
    2868,
    38,
    '{\"email\":\"saloniaryan37495@gmail.com\",\"qid\":\"25030866\",\"course\":\"Btech\",\"year\":\"1\",\"name\":\"Saloni Kumari\",\"problem\":\".In many parts of India, especially rural and semi-urban areas, patients face difficulty in accessing verified and trustworthy doctors. There is a lack of transparency in doctor qualifications, leading to risks of fake or unqualified practitioners. Additionally, language barriers make it hard for patients to communicate their health issues effectively. As a result, people either delay treatment or receive incorrect medical advice.\",\"solution\":\"We propose a smart healthcare platform (mobile app) that connects patients with verified doctors. The platform will use AI and digital verification systems to ensure authenticity of doctors’ qualifications. It will also provide multi-language support so users can interact in their local language.\\nKey features include:\\nVerified doctor profiles with credentials\\nAI-based chatbot for basic health guidance\\nEasy appointment booking and consultation\\nPatient feedback and rating system\\nLocal language support for better communication\\nThis solution aims to make healthcare accessible, reliable, and user-friendly.\",\"target_customer\":\"People living in rural and semi-urban areas\\nPatients who need trusted and verified doctors\\nIndividuals facing language barriers in healthcare\\nBusy urban users looking for quick online consultation\\nSmall clinics/doctors who want to expand their digital presence\"}',
    'pending',
    '2026-03-20 16:34:48',
    NULL,
    '0yxcqe28pvbz782tuauayi'
  );
