  (
    2870,
    38,
    '{\"email\":\"keshavkr56789@gmail.com\",\"qid\":\"24030977\",\"course\":\"Btech\",\"year\":\"2\",\"name\":\"Keshav kumar gupta\",\"problem\":\"Building a home in India is a complex, unorganized, and non-transparent process. Homeowners struggle to find reliable architects, contractors, and interior designers, while also facing unclear cost estimates, lack of project tracking, and frequent delays. The entire process is highly fragmented and still dependent on offline references, making it inefficient and risky.\",\"solution\":\"Arch-Connect is a digital platform that simplifies the home construction process by connecting users with verified architects, contractors, and interior designers. It provides a construction cost calculator for budget estimation, a smart matching system to find suitable professionals, and aims to offer project tracking and secure milestone-based payments in the future, making the entire process transparent and efficient.\",\"target_customer\":\"Homeowners and individuals planning to build, renovate, or design their homes, as well as architects, contractors, and interior designers looking for clients.\"}',
    'pending',
    '2026-03-21 10:41:28',
    NULL,
    '8m2jzlscv0gdzv0m8yaukg'
  );
