VALUES
  (
    2872,
    38,
    '{\"email\":\"vishupanwar00011@gmail.com\",\"qid\":\"23120237\",\"course\":\"BCA\",\"year\":\"3\",\"name\":\"Vishu Panwar \",\"target_customer\":\"Our target customers include property buyers, sellers, renters, and real estate brokers in Tier 2 and Tier 3 cities of India who need a trusted and transparent platform for property transactions.\\n\\nWe also target professionals such as lawyers, architects, designers, engineers, contractors, labour workers, retired officers, and other service providers who want to offer their services and earn through a digital platform.\\n\\nIn addition, we target vendors and businesses who sell real estate and construction materials like cement, bricks, paint, furniture, electrical items, and interior or decoration products, allowing them to reach more customers through our marketplace.\\n\\nGharBazaar is designed for all users involved in the real estate ecosystem, including individuals, brokers, service providers, material suppliers, and small businesses.\",\"problem\":\"In India, the real estate sector, especially in Tier 2 and Tier 3 cities, is highly unorganized and fragmented.\\n\\nPeople face multiple problems while buying, selling, or renting property because they have to depend on brokers, local contacts, and different platforms, which creates confusion and increases the risk of fraud and fake listings.\\n\\nThere is also no single trusted platform where users can find verified brokers, professional service providers like lawyers, architects, labour, or contractors, and real estate materials such as cement, bricks, paint, furniture, and other construction products.\\n\\nBecause of this, users have to search in multiple places, which wastes time, increases cost, and creates trust issues.\\n\\nThe lack of a complete real estate ecosystem makes property transactions slow, risky, and difficult, especially in smaller cities where digital solutions are limited.\",\"solution\":\"GharBazaar is a technology-driven real estate platform designed to make property transactions safe, transparent, and organized, especially in Tier 2 and Tier 3 cities of India.\\n\\nWe are building a complete real estate ecosystem based on three business models:\\n\\n1. Broker Model –  \\nUsers can buy, sell, or rent properties through verified brokers and property owners on the platform.  \\nAll users and properties go through verification to reduce fraud and increase trust.\\n\\n2. Service Provider Model –  \\nProfessionals like lawyers, architects, designers, contractors, labour, engineers, retired officers, and other skilled persons can register on the platform and provide their services to customers.  \\nThis creates earning opportunities for professionals and gives users trusted service providers in one place.\\n\\n3. Marketplace Model –  \\nUsers and vendors can sell real estate related materials such as cement, bricks, paint, furniture, electrical items, interior products, and decoration materials.  \\nThis makes GharBazaar a complete marketplace for all real estate needs.\\n\\nBy combining property dealing, professional services, and material marketplace in one platform, GharBazaar aims to build a scalable and trusted real estate ecosystem across India.\"}',
    'pending',
    '2026-03-21 12:38:40',
    NULL,
    'oxj7qt7lipqr2vu9dstl5'
  );
