    `confirmed_at`,
    `confirmation_token`
  )
VALUES
  (
    2884,
    38,
    '{\"solution\":\"We are building an all-in-one adventure platform that combines a marketplace and a SaaS-based management system.\\n\\nFor users-\\n\\nA platform to search, compare, and book treks across multiple operators in one place.\\n\\nFor operators-\\n\\nA simple dashboard to manage bookings, customers, payments, and batch availability without relying on manual processes.\\n\\nThe platform also provides each operator with a unique booking link that they can share on social media, ensuring they retain their own customers while also gaining new customers from the platform.\\n\\nIn later phases, the platform will expand to include transport, accommodation, and gear services, enabling users to customize complete adventure packages and expand adventure ecosystem.\",\"problem\":\"The adventure tourism industry, especially trekking, is highly unorganized.\\nMost small and medium trek operators manage bookings through WhatsApp, calls, and manual methods, leading to confusion, poor customer experience, and inefficiency.\\nAt the same time, customers face difficulty in discovering, comparing, and booking reliable trekking experiences across different operators in one place.\\nThere is no unified platform that connects users with multiple operators while also providing operators with a simple system to manage their business.\",\"target_customer\":\"Primary-\\n\\nSmall and medium trekking operators who lack proper digital systems for managing bookings and operations.\\n\\nSecondary-\\n\\nYoung travelers, college students, and adventure enthusiasts (18–35 age group) looking for affordable and reliable trekking experiences.\\n\\nFuture Expansion-\\n\\nLarge trekking companies and service providers (transport, stay, gear rental, guides, rafting, mountainring expedition, paragliding) as part of an integrated ecosystem.\\n\\nThis platform aims to organize the fragmented adventure industry by creating a unified ecosystem for both users and operators.\\n\\nWe are building a platform that helps users easily book treks and helps operators manage their business digitally.\",\"email\":\"pravesh.das18@gmail.com\",\"qid\":\"25030303\",\"course\":\"Btech\",\"year\":\"1\",\"name\":\"Pravesh Kumar Das\"}',
    'pending',
    '2026-03-31 13:36:09',
    NULL,
    'ejhk0t0j2g1qu5mgh2g45'
  );
