    2888,
    38,
    '{\"email\":\"ahlawatprince009@gmail.com\",\"name\":\"Prince Ahlawat\",\"qid\":\"25700003\",\"course\":\"BSC Agriculture\",\"problem\":\"Farmers face issues like lack of transparency, delayed payments, middlemen exploitation, difficulty in getting loans, and no product traceability. Consumers also cannot verify food quality or origin, making the agricultural supply chain inefficient and untrustworthy.\",\"solution\":\"AgriChain Connect uses Blockchain, AI, and IoT to create a transparent “soil-to-sale” system.\\nIt provides:\\n•Direct farmer-to-consumer marketplace.\\n•Smart contract-based instant payments.\\n•QR-based product traceability.\\n•AI guidance for farming.\\n•Easy access to verified loans.\\n\\nThis ensures trust, faster payments, and better income for farmers.\",\"target_customer\":\"• Farmers (primary users)\\n• Consumers\\n• Banks & Microfinance institutions\\n• Fertilizer & seed companies\\n• Government agriculture departments\\n• Retailers & food companies\",\"year\":\"1\"}',
    'pending',
