    38,
    '{\"email\":\"bhumikachawla330@gmail.com\",\"name\":\"Bhumika Chawla\",\"qid\":\"24390020\",\"course\":\"BA LLB\",\"year\":\"2\",\"problem\":\"Intellectual Property registration remains out of reach for many due to high overall costs, cumbersome government portals, language barriers, and widespread low awareness. \\nSolo lawyers and small law firms struggle with IP filing and drafting due to excessive paperwork, deadline tracking, record-keeping, and time lost on repetitive drafting.\",\"solution\":\"Our app solves this with affordability, local language support, expert guidance, In-app education, outreach, and time savings.\\nOur AI delivers ready drafts for IP applications and basic replies—lawyers just review and finalize—plus a dashboard for seamless matter tracking, records, and reduced manual work, enabling small teams to handle more cases efficiently. \",\"target_customer\":\"Shopkeepers, small brand owners, startups, incubation centres, solo lawyers and firms \"}',
