    2895,
    38,
    '{\"email\":\"aryangoyal9012@gmail.com\",\"name\":\"Aryan Goyal\",\"qid\":\"24410052\",\"course\":\"B Pharma\",\"year\":\"3\",\"problem\":\"“Access to safe drinking water remains a major challenge, especially during travel, in rural areas, and emergency situations. Many people are forced to consume contaminated water, leading to serious waterborne diseases. Existing solutions like RO systems are not portable, and bottled water is expensive and unsustainable.”\",\"solution\":\"“We are developing a portable water purification pen that uses UV-C sterilization and nano-filtration technology to provide safe drinking water instantly. The device is compact, rechargeable, and designed for use in travel, rural, and emergency conditions, ensuring affordable and accessible clean water.”\",\"target_customer\":\"“Travelers, hikers, students, rural populations, disaster relief organizations, and individuals who need portable and instant access to safe drinking water.”\"}',
    'pending',
    '2026-04-20 15:39:54',
