    38,
    'Genesis Venture Formation Program (GVFP)',
    'genesis-venture-formation-program-gvfp',
    'IDEAS REQUIREMENT:\n- Must address a real-world problem.\n- Should involve technology, Al, or innovation-driven solutions.\n- Must demonstrate novelty, feasibility, and scalability.\n- Idea should be original and not previously registered as a company.\n- Grant Aid upto 1 LAC\nLast Date for Entry 31 MARCH\n\nELIGIBILITY:\n- Open to all students of Quantum University (UG/PG/PhD)\n- Individual or team participation (up to 5 members)\n- Interdisciplinary teams are encouraged',
